  m_Name: StartPage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::JournalPage
  leftPageText: '<b>To whom it may concern, you are dead.</b>

    Any ghost will
    need to learn and adapt, as things will be very different.

    I, too, was a
    fresh ghost once. I have recorded my findings for you to learn from.'
  rightPageText: '<b>CLICKABLE COMPONENTS:</b>

    Some puzzles will require your
    mouse. You can use your cursor to click and drag certain puzzle components. You
    will only click things that show up in a popup.

'
